{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1016390-secrets-of-the-covenants-hidden-devotions","id":1016390,"title":"Secrets of the Covenants: Hidden Devotions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-12T21:01:13-08:00","id":1016390,"title":"Secrets of the Covenants: Hidden Devotions","content":"For people who want them, here they are.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://pastebin.com/u/ericateachesnyc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://pastebin.com/u/ericateachesnyc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://pastebin.com/u/ericateachesnyc\" target=\"_blank\"> http://pastebin.com/u/ericateachesnyc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://pastebin.com/u/knightchelsea\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://pastebin.com/u/knightchelsea\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://pastebin.com/u/knightchelsea\" target=\"_blank\"> http://pastebin.com/u/knightchelsea </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambi